rfa:AutomatedReviewOutput
  a owl:Class, skos:Concept, rfa:ContextTerm ;
  skos:prefLabel "Automated Review Output"@en ;
  skos:definition "Feedback published by a recognized automated reviewer for a PR Status Check, treated as fully published once that check is terminal. No comment means no feedback. Present but visibly incomplete output (harness-classified from the latest correlated recognized-reviewer comment body: finished banner plus unchecked Aggregate-style substantive progress task and/or missing synthesis) is a failed review eligible for at most one harness-authorized whole-workflow recovery rerun on the same Work Item, PR head SHA, and workflow run; a repeated identical incomplete outcome enters Needs Human without another autonomous rerun or Investigate rediscovery loop. Agent-reported whole-review reruns remain bounded by the general three-rerun budget (ADR 0027). Needs Human reasons name the automated review workflow or check identity and must not read as blaming the Work Item implement Agent Model."@en ;
  skos:hiddenLabel "Eventually consistent review comment"@en, "pending comment"@en .

